  "prefLabel": "Vet 307.03 Practice Under a Licensed Veterinarian",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Vet 307.03 Practice Under a Licensed Veterinarian. Pursuant to RSA 332-B:11, II, conditional licensees shall practice under the direct supervision of a veterinary ian licensed in New Hampshire.\n\nSource. #14397, eff 11-23-25, EXPIRES: 11-23-35",
